{
  "bookId": "hero-212111",
  "id": "bond-43809",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "43809001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "这是……前些日子见过的灯市。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43809003",
              "text": "没错，是等比例缩小的布景。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43809002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43809003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "为什么特意送我这个？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43809005",
              "text": "你似乎很喜欢看花灯"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43809005",
              "text": "逛街时你看上去心情很好"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43809004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43809005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "果然瞒不住你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43809006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "我确不厌烦节庆时的人间街市，看到万家的灯火，如织的人流，心底便不觉泛起暖意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43809007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "某种意义上……花灯与曾经的赤龙相同，它们身上都寄寓了人们的美好愿望。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43809009",
              "text": "那么，你的愿望是什么？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43809008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43809009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "我？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43809010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "……我没有愿望。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43809012",
              "text": "我并不是在询问传说中的赤龙"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43809011",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43809012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我在问与我朝夕相处的少女，龙缨。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43809013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "……我很难回答。自从来了人间，我便时常感到心绪激荡，不像过去一般平静。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43809014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "许多本该有答案的问题，也失掉了回答的底气。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43809015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "但若你仅是询问「龙缨」的想法……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43809016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "少女定定地凝视着你，仍由沉默弥漫。她的气息并不平稳，仿佛在水下燃烧的火。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43809017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "她……许愿，与你相伴的时光，能够直抵永恒。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43809018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "龙缨",
          "text": "你会答应她吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43809019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "于是你开口，向她说出了深藏心底的答案。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
